abstract: >-
  Inventory of spaceborne thermal infrared (MWIR, about 3-5 um; LWIR, about 8-14 um)
  instrument designs and the satellite platform deployments carrying them, with
  record-level specification and status sources. Statuses are fixed at the audit
  date of 18 August 2026.
